course: dictionary
lesson: 9985
title: One word, three jobs
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Tech is a short word for technology, like computers, phones and the internet. The words around it show you which meaning you need. «Theo decided he was a tech genius and turned the router off and on forty times in one evening.» A genius at machines is someone very skilled with technology, so tech here means technology.
explain: The same word can do different jobs. In «a tech company», tech is an adjective describing the company: it uses new technology. When tech means a person who fixes machines, it is a noun, short for technician. Ask yourself: what word would fit here? Then swap in technology or technician and see if the sentence still makes sense.
explain: «Every time had its own exciting tech.» The clue is exciting: each period in history had its own new machines and gadgets. Swapping in technology still makes sense, so that is the meaning. Always check your meaning in the sentence before you decide.
fact: Tech is short for technology: computers, phones and the internet.
fact: A tech can be a person who fixes machines or computers. It is short for technician.
fact: As an adjective, tech describes things that use new technology, such as a tech company.
fact: «Tech» appears in everyday words like tech support, high-tech and low-tech.
fact: Staying safe with tech means setting screen time limits and keeping personal details private online.
exercise: In «a tech company», what kind of word is tech? | A person who fixes machines | A verb meaning to climb | *An adjective, describing a company that uses new technology | A short word for tennis
exercise: «Every time had its own exciting tech.» What does tech mean here? | A person who fixes clocks | *New machines and gadgets | Stories from long ago | Sad songs
exercise: When tech means a person who fixes machines, what is it short for? | A tennis player | A tenant | *Technician | A teacher
test: Tech is short for which word? | *Technology | Team | Teeth | Teacher
test: Which thing could be described as tech? | A pile of leaves | A bicycle with no gears | *A phone company using the newest technology | A wooden spoon
exam: Jayden says, «Tech is always a person.» What is the best answer? | Yes, tech always means a person who fixes machines | *No, tech can be a short word for technology, a person who fixes machines, or an adjective describing things with new technology | No, tech only means a sports game | Yes, tech is always a verb
